---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Page not found — Wisdom Technosoft"
  description="That page is not here. Head back to the Wisdom Technosoft home page, or get in touch."
  noindex={true}
  hasRuler={false}
  bodyClass="stub"
>
  <header class="stub-head">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Wisdom Technosoft home">
      <img src="/assets/logo-mark.png" alt="" class="brand-logo" width="36" height="30">
      <span class="brand-name">Wisdom Technosoft</span>
    </a>
    <a class="stub-back" href="/">&larr; Back to home</a>
  </header>

  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="stub-main">
    <div class="w stub-container">
      <div class="notfound-box grid-frame">
        <div class="crosshair crosshair-tl"></div>
        <div class="crosshair crosshair-tr"></div>
        <div class="crosshair crosshair-bl"></div>
        <div class="crosshair crosshair-br"></div>

        <div class="stub-top-meta">
          <span class="eyebrow">HTTP // 404 STATUS</span>
          <span class="blueprint-tag">ROUTE NOT MAPPED</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="sec-title">That page isn&rsquo;t in the directory.</h1>
        <p class="lead-prose">
          The link may have changed, or the route had a typo. Zero downtime elsewhere &mdash; the core application is running normally.
        </p>

        <div class="action-btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">
            <span>Return to home page</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <h2 class="stub-h">Architectural Index</h2>
        <ul class="quick-links">
          <li><a href="/#services" class="lnk"><strong>01 Services</strong> &mdash; Software, telecalling squads, data ETL, US medical billing</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#approach" class="lnk"><strong>02 Approach</strong> &mdash; 4 Operating disciplines &amp; SLA commitments</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#vision" class="lnk"><strong>03 Vision &amp; Ethos</strong> &mdash; Purpose, clarity, care, consistency</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#team" class="lnk"><strong>04 Leadership</strong> &mdash; Executive &amp; technical divisions</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#contact" class="lnk"><strong>05 Contact</strong> &mdash; Direct inquiries &amp; project scoping</a></li>
        </ul>

        <p class="stub-nav">
          Wisdom Technosoft, Nagpur, Maharashtra, India &middot; 
          <a href="mailto:wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com" class="lnk">wisdomtechnosoft04@gmail.com</a> &middot; 
          <a href="tel:+917447331127" class="lnk">+91 74473 31127</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .stub {
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .stub-head {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-inline: var(--g);
    height: var(--nav-h, 70px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .brand-name {
    font-family: var(--disp);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .stub-back {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .stub-main {
    padding-block: 60px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .stub-container {
    max-width: 860px;
  }
  .notfound-box {
    padding: 48px;
    background: var(--surface-card);
  }
  .stub-top-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .lead-prose {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .action-btn-row {
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
  .stub-h {
    font-family: var(--disp);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .quick-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .stub-nav {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .notfound-box {
      padding: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
